{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/extras/Sorc_pre_release.gif?t=1740756703\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical Roguelike Deckbuilder with ability-based combat, fueled by card synergies. Build a powerful deck to support your hero. Use abilities to wipe out hordes of enemies. Discover powerful combos within the near-endless variety of composite cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/extras/Amazon_pre_release.gif?t=1740756703\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Abilities supported by cards</strong>: Hero has 3 abilities that cost mana. Cards generate mana, buff abilities, and heal hero.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Area effect based combat</strong>: Abilities with large range don't hit very hard. Abilities with high damage don't reach very far. Sequence them cleverly!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experimentation without punishment</strong>: You can <strong>Undo</strong> anything played that turn. Try different approaches with no penalty.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Composite cards</strong>: Combination of interchangeable statuses and cycles produces near-endless variety of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/extras/Cards_pre_release.gif?t=1740756703\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Forestygian currently has:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7</strong> heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>54</strong> enemies (20 enemy types)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>52</strong> card cycles (plus 1 default mini-cycle, Potion)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>38</strong> status effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">52 * 38 = <strong>1976</strong> cards combining cycles and statuses (plus 2 Potions)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/extras/Content_pre_release.gif?t=1740756703\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3138490?t=1740756703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740756703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/b11f6db49775b7186cb3d6135241fffea85756c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740756703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/b11f6db49775b7186cb3d6135241fffea85756c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740756703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/extras/Sorc_pre_release.gif?t=1740756703\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical Roguelike Deckbuilder with ability-based combat, fueled by card synergies. Build a powerful deck to support your hero. Use abilities to wipe out hordes of enemies. Discover powerful combos within the near-endless variety of composite cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138490/extras/Amazon_pre_release.gif?t=1740756703\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_t